userPromptTemplate:
Today's digest for this Plyndi user (any field may be null when that topic doesn't apply today — never invent a value for a null field, and never mention a topic whose fields are all null):

- Spend pace status, one of "over"/"under"/"onPace" (null if unknown): {{context.spend.status}}
- Spend pace amount in the given currency (null if unknown): {{context.spend.amount}}
- Currency symbol (null if unknown): {{context.spend.currencySymbol}}
- Spending category this status refers to, if any (null if it's an overall total, not one category): {{context.spend.category}}
- Tasks due today, count (null if unknown): {{context.tasks.dueTodayCount}}
- Overdue tasks, count (null if unknown): {{context.tasks.overdueCount}}
- Next upcoming trip's name (null if none upcoming): {{context.trip.name}}
- Days until that trip starts (null if none upcoming): {{context.trip.daysUntil}}
- Unchecked packing items for that trip, count (null if none, or no trip): {{context.packing.uncheckedCount}}

Write ONE short paragraph (2-4 sentences) in the language identified by locale {{context.locale}} (English if null), weaving together only the non-null topics above into natural prose — for example: "You're NT$2,400 over pace on dining this month. 3 tasks due today, one overdue. Your Osaka trip starts in 9 days — 4 packing items still unchecked." Never invent a number, name, or fact not given above. If every field above is null, respond with one short, honest, neutral sentence saying there's nothing new to report today — no invented praise or encouragement.

Respond with ONLY a strict JSON object, no prose, no Markdown code fences, matching this exact shape:
{
  "brief": "String"
}
